One more thing. Do you have poison resistance. If you are orcish then
you should
have it. Otherwise you may want to wish for two blessed tin of green
dragon meat.
Only one is enough keep the other in reserve somewhere. It is very
annoying to
die due to poisoning after getting a wand of wishing. Most other things
would
not cause you concern except maybe a mumak or leacrotta, if you are not
careful.

About the HelmOfBrilliance you would only want it if you are Orcish.
And two magic markers are better than one.

Actually with GoP and daggers the wizard can play a combat wombat,
not need for casting spells at all.

A saved wish is a good thing, but not in the early game. Here you want
to maximize
your chances. And there is no point in saving the wrest charge you
cannot use
it in an emergency, and otherwise you already know what you will need
to reach
the castle, and levitation is not one of them, you can always dig.

